r already orders/omits.\n- src/cli/review.ts: pinOrLive for non-staged scopes; try/finally with\n  `durable` flag set after initializeRun deletes a captured ref.\n- Tests: test/snapshot/snapshot.ts (module seam), test/cli/review-snapshot.ts.\n- Mutation-checked: disabling ref deletion fails the usage-error test;\n  not using the pin fails both pinned-read tests.\n- Readings: \"no HEAD\" CLI test uses `git update-ref -d HEAD` in\n  settingsRepo (main.go stays staged). Finder failure = HTTP 400 with\n  max_attempts 1.\n- test/cli/review-errors.ts built-CLI tests need a fresh `npm run bundle`.\n- One early unreproduced failure in test/snapshot/snapshot.ts (1 of 48)\n  right after the file was rewritten on disk; 18+ reruns clean.\nEOF\nnpm test > /tmp/full22.txt 2>&1; echo exit $?; grep -E \"passing|failing|^# (tests|pass|fail)\" /tmp/full22.txt | tail -5","description":"Write area notes and run full test suite","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":331,"cache_read_input_tokens":145614,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":331},"output_tokens":485,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7ad23c81-404a-48c1-af0c-22c3c0a830e9","uuid":"84f4723e-ce19-45d2-8b19-7beef93aca35","timestamp":"2026-11-24T02:00:48.941Z","request_id":"req_011ChLvksCyfBJ9NbdQyvEWa","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01XX8ZycD3Yg2xnw41zv3wX1":{"command":"cd /Users/nick/code/roast.ts-rewrite-22-review-snapshots && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='docs/agents/scope-context.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"## Tests\n\"\"\",\"\"\"## Snapshot\n\n- `src/snapshot/snapshot.ts` owns `liveIndexPath` and `copyIndex`;\n  `pinIndexTree` (context) uses them too. Every function takes\n  `{env, signal}`; pass t